575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "158267188", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035779583", "personaname": "Jordon0105", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035779583/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 4720, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2157, "last_played": 1721693711, "avatar": "9b75cb8641bec11676f66f3d8eb4995ddec08908"}, "language": "english", "review": "I met god and i killed him.", "timestamp_created": 1707870093, "timestamp_updated": 1707870093, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "158259994", "author": {"steamid": "76561198103285848", "personaname": "Warden Lvl 2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198103285848/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 2340, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2200, "last_played": 1783312798, "avatar": "6d29e4d7c2c8f04320bd63fc6d158cddad2cdee5"}, "language": "english", "review": "An absolute must grab... although the \"EDF song\" in this one is not as good as the last one it's still pretty good and that's honestly the only 'bad thing' I have to say about it, 10/10 Ez\nI have not played or purchased the DLC, YET, I will undoubtedly be buying it the near future I just want to unlock some more stuff for the classes, I played Fencer from beginning to end with Dexter shotgun and Force sword + Med range auto cannon and Gallion cannon. Fantastic Combo and very fun to use.\nWith that said I played on easy on single player the Multiplayer limits your weapon level but the combo I mentioned only goes up to level 2 weapons so if you want to do the same you should be able to use them so long as you have unlocked/found them.\nIf you haven't got the game yet, if you're looking for just chaotic fun you will not be disappointed!", "timestamp_created": 1707861171, "timestamp_updated": 1707861171, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "158185905", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116417677", "personaname": "Bable Vaunt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198116417677/", "num_games_owned": 279, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 19716, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10753, "last_played": 1750643195, "avatar": "467f4be6368d7c8b5c56b2a898918e836a7dfaf3"}, "language": "english", "review": "The moment this game clicked for me is when I decided to play through on hard. Eventually I ran into a level where I didn't disintegrate whatever mass of insects was in front of me before they could kill me. When you run into those situations, you become encourage to experiment with the hundreds of weapons at your disposal, and you keep throwing yourself and the level until you eventually find a working strategy. \n\nIts a very satisfying gameplay loop. If you turn the voice volume to 0 you're playing this game wrong btw, the radio chatter during the stages is hysterical and provide decent ques for when more enemies spawn if you're stuck in a harder level. \n\nSpam those voice lines and kill some bugs.\n\nEDF!!! EDF!!! EDF!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1707773124, "timestamp_updated": 1707846145, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}